  "description": "Front-loads steganography triage for CTF files. Use when an image, audio file, video, GIF, PDF or text file is described as containing something hidden, or when a challenge gives media with no obvious purpose, \"stego\", LSB, bit plane, palette, spectrogram, QR or metadata hints. Runs the project's preset sweep and filter library first instead of re-deriving extraction code, then routes to the stego MCP for structured checks. Do not use it for pure disk/memory/network forensics, for crypto on recovered data, or for reversing an encoder binary.",
